Promise 2 is RED (redbase_test.sh 24/2 since 7ffb0fb) — numbers minted on a stale verdict are not publishable.

Paused 2026-08-17 by human decision, alongside the approved CHALLENGE in PROJECT.md's session log.

The bug: after a red base is genuinely fixed, .rabadon/net.json keeps the stale
red verdict, so a verdict this script reads and publishes may describe a state
that is no longer true. The overnight range that carried the counter from 490 to
502 refused was minted under that bug and is tainted; it must be re-derived from
the ledger, not trusted, once the base is green.

Resume: delete this file after `bash native/redbase_test.sh` prints 26 ok, 0 fail
and CI is green on both platforms.
